    "claim": "The peer mesh replaces the lighthouse's discovery job: endpoints reports a host's candidates plus the platform-OBSERVED address of any connected peer (recorded on user records by the UDP welcome path), the UI's syncMesh pushes the merged map to every member via update_hosts, and save_config renders it into static_host_map with punchy punch/respond. Verified end-to-end 2026-08-26: two instances in separate netns joined over the peer channel and exchanged overlay pings on nebula 1.9.5 with zero lighthouses configured.",
