  {
    "claim": "Supervised tunnel contract: start tracks each Child in the NEBULA_CHILDREN static (declared in start.rs's import block, shared as crate::nebula::nebula::start::NEBULA_CHILDREN), keeps a bounded output tail in globals nebulaservices.<name>.log, and try_waits after a 700ms grace so instant deaths (bad config, no tun) return err with the process output instead of a false OK. stop kills via the static; info merges this state into running/supervised per network. State lives in the server process only - a separate newbound mcp process sees its own empty globals.",
