  {
    "claim": "flowlang system_call exposes no exit code (out/err/status only, status err just means spawn failed), so the systemd service commands run systemctl via std::process::Command::output and read status.success(); string-returning commands signal failure to the UI by the ERROR: prefix, which outcome() in the js facet recognizes. Never report tool stderr as success - systemctl enable writes to stderr even when it works.",
